{"id":"P056-1","subject":"P","unit":"P056","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P056-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n인덕턴스가 각각 , 인 두 개의 코일을 직렬접속 할\n\n때 합성 인덕턴스가 가동접속인 경우 70mH , 차동접속\n\n인 경우 10mH 이다. 두 코일의 상호 인덕턴스는 몇\n\nmH인가?\n\n\n① 15          ② 20\n\n③ 25          ④ 30\n\n⑤ 35","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":648},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":693}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n1.7F의 콘덴서 과 0.3F의 콘덴서 를 병렬로\n접속하였다. 각 콘덴서의 전하가 × C, × C\n\n일 때, 콘덴서의 합성 정전 에너지는 몇 J인가?\n\n\n① 12.25             ② 12.50\n\n③ 13.75             ④ 15.25\n\n⑤ 17.50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":900}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n비유전율 3, 비투자율 3인 매질에서 전자파의 전파속도는\n\n몇 ms인가?\n\n\n① ×         ② \n③ ×         ④ × \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":480},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1150}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n그림과 같이 전류가 흐르는 반원형 도선이 평면 상에\n\n놓여있다.\n이 도선이 자속밀도 m인\n균일자계 내에 놓여 있을 때, 도선의 직선 부분에 작용하\n\n는 힘은 몇 N 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n①   ② \n③      ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":1158},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":685},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m04-e2.webp","width":678,"height":874}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n정현파 교류 전류의 평균값에 어떠한 수를 곱하면 실횻값\n\n을 얻을 수 있는가?\n\n                         \n①            ②      \n                          \n③            ④        \n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1010}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n       \n         의 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n                               \n①            ②   \n\n                           \n③            ④   \n\n        \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m06-q.webp","width":678,"height":667},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1208}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n의 라플라스 변환으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n                           \n①           ②                               \n\n                           \n③           ④                               \n\n   \n⑤     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":635},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":674}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n단상 200V의 전압을 가하면 12.5A의 전류가 흐르고,\n\n1.5kW의 전력을 소비하는 코일에 병렬로 콘덴서를\n\n접속하여 역률을 100로 하려고 한다. 여기에 필요한\n\n용량성 리액턴스는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 12          ② 18.6\n\n③ 20          ④ 22.2\n\n⑥ 26","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":581},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1350}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n다음과 같은 4단자 회로망의 4단자 정수 중 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n①      ② \n③       ④ \n\n     \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m09-q.webp","width":696,"height":662},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":532}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n\n다음과 같이 표시되는 동작에서 비례감도, 미분시간,\n\n적분시간을 순서대로 나열할 때, 옳은 것은?\n\n       \n\n\n\n① 2, 0.4, 2       ② 2, 0.4, 4\n\n③ 4, 0.2, 2       ④ 4, 0.2, 4\n\n⑤ 8, 0.4, 2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":590},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":869}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n            \n         의 크기와 위상각을 나타낸 것은?\n\n\n               \n①               ∠tan \n\n               \n②             ∠tan \n③ ∠tan\n\n                \n④                 ∠tan \n\n                \n⑤               ∠tan ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":631},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":426}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n변압기의 무부하시험과 단락시험을 통해 알 수 있는 것은?\n\n   ㉠ 단락 임피던스    ㉡ 임피던스 전압\n\n   ㉢ 기계손        ㉣ 단락비\n\n   ㉤ 철손\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉢㉣\n\n③ ㉡㉢㉤        ④ ㉢㉣㉤\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉣㉤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m12-q.webp","width":678,"height":571},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n60Hz, 4극, 190kW의 3상 유도전동기의 전부하 2차\n\n동손이 6kW, 기계손이 4kW인 경우, 전부하 회전수는\n\n몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 1480         ② 1562\n\n③ 1692         ④ 1746\n\n⑤ 1764","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1428}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n전원 주파수가 60Hz인 3상 유도전동기의 슬립이 0.05\n\n일 때, 회전자 주파수는 몇 Hz인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":629},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":454}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n배전선의 전력손실 경감대책으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 부하용량을 크게한다.\n\n② 고유저항이 낮은 전선을 사용한다.\n\n③ 배전 전압을 높인다.\n\n④ 역률을 개선한다.\n\n⑤ 부하의 불평형을 방지한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m15","number":15},"questionIm