ion-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1437}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n어떤 수용가의 월 평균사용 전력량이 7200kWh이고,\n\n최대 사용전력이 50kW일 때, 수용가의 부하율은 몇\n\n인가? (단, 한 달은 30일이다.)\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.8\n\n③ 10          ④ 15\n\n⑤ 20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m18-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":445},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m18-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1361}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P056-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n분포정수회로에서 직렬 임피던스를 , 병렬 어드미턴스를\n\n라고 할 때, 선로의 특성 임피던스는?\n\n①          ② \n\n                \n③             ④            \n\n  \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 서울교통공사 9호선(운전) (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e15-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":1239},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e15-m19